## State & Data Flow

- Global state via Zustand stores in [store](mdc:src/store/)
  - Tasks: [store/tasks.js](mdc:src/store/tasks.js)
  - Journals: [store/journals.js](mdc:src/store/journals.js)
  - Auth/Settings: [store/auth.js](mdc:src/store/auth.js) (if present)
- Fetch on Dashboard mount: see [pages/Dashboard/index.jsx](mdc:src/pages/Dashboard/index.jsx)
- Keep API updates in sync with store using store’s `update` helpers
- Maintain ordering fields like `rank` on sortable resources

### Transformers

- Use transformers for DB↔UI mapping to keep component code in camelCase
- Add new mapping entries in the relevant transformer file
